error: '`default_transition' requires a transition time
   --> /default_directives.va:11:1
   |
11 | `default_transition
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ expected a transition time
   |
   = 10.3: '`default_transition <transition_time>', where the time is a real number such as 1n

error: a transition time cannot be negative
   --> /default_directives.va:15:1
   |
15 | `default_transition -1n
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ negative transition time
   |
   = 4.5.8: a rise time and a fall time 'shall be non-negative'

warning: a default discipline for 'reg' nets can never apply
   --> /default_directives.va:23:31
   |
23 | `default_discipline ddiscrete reg
   |                               ^^^ no net can be of type 'reg'
   |
   = info: the default would be in force and apply to nothing
   = help: Verilog-A declares nets without a net type, so only an unqualified directive (or one qualified 'wire', their default type) reaches them

error: 'bogus' is not a net type
   --> /default_directives.va:24:32
   |
24 | `default_discipline electrical bogus
   |                                ^^^^^ not a net type
   |
   = 10.2: '`default_discipline [discipline [ qualifier ] ]', where the qualifier is one of integer, real, reg, wreal, wire, tri, wand, triand, wor, trior, trireg, tri0, tri1, supply0, supply1

error: '`default_transition' is not allowed inside a module
   --> /default_directives.va:30:5
   |
30 |     `default_transition 1n
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ directive is used inside a module
   |
   = 10.3: the directive 'can be used only outside of module definitions'
   = help: move it above the module, where it applies to every transition filter the module contains

